      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرِيدٌ</span></b>  <i>Distant,</i> or <i>remote:</i> (K:) of the dial. of
El-Yemen. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>Custom, habit,</i> or
<i>wont.</i> (Lh, K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا زَالَ ذٰلِكَ عَرِيدَهُ</span>
<i>That ceased not to be his custom, habit,</i> or <i>wont.</i>
(Lh, TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرْبَدٌّ</span>.]

